{"id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-generic-object.md","title":"弱、普通与强泛对象","display":"df-generic-object — 弱、普通与强泛对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-generic-object","display":"df-generic-object — 弱、普通与强泛对象","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-fibre]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]"],"source":"Definition 5.2.8 and Lemma 5.2.9, pp. 325–326 (PDF 345–346)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-generic-object"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-generic-object"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generic-object — 弱、普通与强泛对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 5.2.8 and Lemma 5.2.9, pp. 325–326 (PDF 345–346)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-generic-object</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Omega\">\\(G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal E_\\Omega\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a> 的同一纤维构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongGeneric}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongGeneric}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}object}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists f:X\\to G)\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists!u:pX\\to\\Omega)\n(\\exists f:X\\to G)\\bigl(pf=u\\land\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongGeneric}_p(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists!f:X\\to G)\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}object}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists f:X\\to G)\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists!u:pX\\to\\Omega)\n(\\exists f:X\\to G)\\bigl(pf=u\\land\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongGeneric}_p(G)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists!f:X\\to G)\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>普通泛对象要求分类基箭头唯一；纤维同构的见证未必唯一。强泛对象进一步要求整条笛卡尔箭头唯一。</li>\n<li>带提升选择时，普通泛性等价于每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 都垂直同构于唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*G\">\\(u^*G\\)</span>。预序纤维中普通与强泛性一致。</li>\n<li>分裂泛对象的严格对象双射另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2508bee9cd5dcead\" href=\"?note=2508bee9cd5dcead\" title=\"16-df-split-generic\">16-df-split-generic</a>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 5.2.8 and Lemma 5.2.9, pp. 325–326 (PDF 345–346)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，$\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$，$G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Omega$；$\\mathcal E_\\Omega$ 使用 [[16-df-fibre]] 的同一纤维构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-generic","status":"resolved","id":"2508bee9cd5dcead","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"分裂泛对象的严格对象双射另见 [[16-df-split-generic]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongGeneric}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}object}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(G)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists f:X\\to G)\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists!u:pX\\to\\Omega)\n(\\exists f:X\\to G)\\bigl(pf=u\\land\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongGeneric}_p(G)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall X\\in\\mathcal E)(\\exists!f:X\\to G)\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"u^*G","display":false}],"bytes":1855,"backlinks":[{"id":"7dbb9ea84aee2b45","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"“由泛对象分类”是另一个概念，见 [[16-df-generic-object]]；它不能替代本书 §9.6 的 definability。"},{"id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}$、$\\mathrm{FibPre}$、$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinCoprod}$、$\\mathrm{Generic}_q$ 分别采用 [[16-df-closed-comprehension]]、[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]；$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 见 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。"},{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-generic-object]]。"},{"id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]。"},{"id":"928bcf665de24775","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$ 是泛对象候选，$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用 [[16-df-generic-object]]；其基对象为 $pG$。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 在下文定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-generic-object|df-generic-object — 弱、普通与强泛对象]]"},{"id":"8022d02fee1d4e94","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p$ 与 $\\mathrm{Generic}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-generic-object]] 的不同量词条件；前者只要求存在分类基箭头。$\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)$ 及其函子 $\\Phi_U$ 见 [[16-thm-full-internal-category]]。"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","aa1ce0bab1ae8910","427be4d627513590","2508bee9cd5dcead"]}